["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: Carbon in the Arena, Mistral&#x27;s Le Chonk, the Agent-Run Economy, Ferroelectric RAM + New Hacks EUV Mixture of Experts (MoE) ferroelectric memory APT\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-31-cogrev-生产数据显示openai比anthropic更少撒谎/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bce300797e23ca51-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>生產數據顯示OpenAI比Anthropic更少撒謊</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Arena用真實生產對話打分：OpenAI在未授權操作、虛假歸因、欺騙性完成三項信號上全面反超Anthropic，個位數誤導率換算到真實用量已經相當可觀。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI對齊</span><span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Using Agents for Long-Horizon Financial Work — Aman Singh, Arca harness managed agents fiduciary RMD prompt injection\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-31-latentspace-ai原生财富管理公司-不是人在催ai-是ai在催人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f748ae3e2793f6d3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">26:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>AI原生財富管理公司：不是人在催AI，是AI在催人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這家財富管理公司不是套了AI工具的服務商，而是AI原生的公司本身：智能體主動聯繫顧問與客戶、持續追蹤他們的稅務和退休計劃，人類只負責審批和執行交易。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能體</span><span class=\"tag\">財富管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Skeptics Guide #1112 - Oct 31 2026 Scopus regression discontinuity design Penning trap CPT symmetry APOE4\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-31-skeptics-超3500家亮红灯的问题期刊-照样被主流数据库收录/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4dc31b3b84e70d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:54:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Skeptics Guide</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>超3500家亮紅燈的問題期刊，照樣被主流數據庫收錄</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究發現3753家期刊出現造假預警信號，其中3557家仍被Scopus正常收錄，說明「發表論文」本身已不再等於可信。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科研誠信</span><span class=\"tag\">期刊造假</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Helen Duncan ectoplasm teleplasm materialization medium Vagrancy Act Witchcraft Act 1735 Fraudulent Mediums Act\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-31-stuffmissed-她在降神会说中两艘军舰沉没-英国用巫术法让她闭嘴/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">38:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>她在降神會說中兩艘軍艦沉沒，英國用巫術法讓她閉嘴</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">檢察官當庭聲明這與巫術無關，純屬詐騙，但真正促使動用1735年巫術法的，是她曾說中兩艘英國軍艦的沉沒，軍方擔心她在諾曼底登陸前走漏消息。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">靈媒詐騙</span><span class=\"tag\">二戰諜報</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Dan Williams on Why AI (Probably) Won’t Kill Us AI as Normal Technology stochastic parrots NIMBY post-training conflict entrepreneurs\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-31-goodfight-大语言模型其实是社交媒体的反面-而非升级版/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>大語言模型其實是社交媒體的反面，而非升級版</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">社交媒體靠算法放大聳動內容拉低公共討論，目前的ChatGPT、Claude、Gemini甚至Grok卻默認追求準確剋制——但這優勢未必持久。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育</span><span class=\"tag\">虛假信息</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can AI Fix Professional Networking? | Inside Cosign MCP coincidence of intent golden handcuffs agent-to-agent protocol\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-31-a16z-领英永远不会做的事-开放一张可搜索的人脉信任图谱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">25:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>領英永遠不會做的事：開放一張可搜索的人脈信任圖譜</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">a16z 押注的 Cosign 認為，招聘的下一步不是海投簡歷，而是你信任的人——未來甚至是你的 AI agent——替你做第一輪篩選。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">招聘</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1370: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin clade 2.3.4.4B seroconversion ELISpot assay TH1/TH2 response post-exposure prophylaxis\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-31-twiv-佛罗里达若废除入学强制接种-模型预测五年内数百儿童将死于麻疹/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>佛羅里達若廢除入學強制接種，模型預測五年內數百兒童將死於麻疹</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用數學模型測算，取消學校強制接種疫苗的要求將在佛羅里達引發近半個世紀來美國最大規模麻疹疫情，五年內數百名兒童和嬰兒可能因此死亡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共衛生</span><span class=\"tag\">禽流感</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"⚡ Building ChatGPT for Finance — Joseph Kim, OpenAI&#x27;s Head of Financial Services MCP RLHF reward model readability GDP eval\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-31-latentspace-现成数据接口错误率超40-逼得openai自建数据管道/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c081d94ef2cea125-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">27:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>現成數據接口錯誤率超40%，逼得OpenAI自建數據管道</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">測試發現部分知名MCP數據連接器錯誤率超40%，促使OpenAI放棄直接調用插件，轉而自建數據管道作為金融產品的核心競爭力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">金融AI</span><span class=\"tag\">企業產品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Anthropic S-1 Shocker, Greatest Business Ever? Google&#x27;s $500B Wipeout, Midterm Predictions S-1 convertible notes recursive self-improvement (RSI) Vickrey auction ARR\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-30-allin-anthropic800亿美元亏损是假账-实际烧钱不到100亿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8f622bd4f103f10-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic800億美元虧損是假賬，實際燒錢不到100億</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">那800億虧損來自給亞馬遜等基礎設施夥伴發的可轉換票據——估值越漲賬面虧損越大，但錢從沒真花出去，實際總燒錢只有90億到100億美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Anthropic IPO</span><span class=\"tag\">AI估值</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Future of Financial Advice: Masters in Business with Rich Steinmeier RIA wire house non-compete transition assistance ERISA 40-30-30 portfolio\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-30-mastersinbiz-没有竞业协议-顾问随时能走-这家万亿资管公司流失率却最低/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>沒有競業協議、顧問隨時能走，這家萬億資管公司流失率卻最低</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">LPL的顧問是獨立老闆，沒有競業協議，想走就走，LPL甚至幫他們帶走客戶資料，逼著自己每天重新贏得信任，流失率因此遠低於行業的5%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">財富管理</span><span class=\"tag\">獨立顧問模式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Happens When Everyone Can Build Software RSI vibe coding Lindy effect PLG\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-30-ycsp-数据库公司七成新增用量来自ai代理-不是人类工程师/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/30dacdc60410d57c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">48:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>數據庫公司七成新增用量來自AI代理，不是人類工程師</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">各行各業的人不再需要說服工程師才能動手：AI讓懂業務的人直接建出複雜系統，這個新建造者群體的增長目前看不到天花板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">開發者工具</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Was I wrong about open models &amp; cyber risks? open-weight model offense-defense balance sigmoid ClickFix\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-30-interconnects-被渲染成网络武器的开源模型发布后-世界并没有崩溃/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e4c5ea11768e1209-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">9:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>被渲染成網絡武器的開源模型發布後，世界並沒有崩潰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">開源模型跨過了被認為的網絡武器門檻一個多月，沒有證據顯示發生了質變級災難，但作者承認這仍將是一場代價不低的行業被迫升級。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Robert Caro – The master biographer reflects at 91 eminent domain majority leader\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-30-dwarkesh-写权力如何腐化人的传记作家说-美国建不成东西-是矫枉过正/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/210def115ef0731e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>寫權力如何腐化人的傳記作家說：美國建不成東西，是矯枉過正</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他說如今的環評、社區委員會和訴訟並不比摩西那個年代的建設障礙少；真正稀缺的，是願意想辦法繞開一切阻力把事情做成的那種人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">基建</span><span class=\"tag\">權力與治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Silicon Valley Walks the Jagged Edge jagged edge RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) bullwhip effect golden path structurally short\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-30-asianometry-想做多算力-光囤芯片不够-不借钱加仓就是-结构性做空/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/de22d2d519cce16c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">18:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>想做多算力，光囤芯片不夠：不借錢加倉就是「結構性做空」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">有人向作者解釋，光靠融資買夠算力已經不算真正「做多」——還得借債加倉芯片，否則就是在「結構性做空」自己，這是硅谷圈內流傳的一句玩笑話。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">半導體設備</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why AI Could Turn Small Law Firms Into Billion-Dollar Businesses contingency (law) plaintiff law cause of action ADR (automated dispute resolution) long horizon agents\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-30-a16z-小型律所靠ai也能做到十亿美元生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>小型律所靠AI也能做到十億美元生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">原告律師的瓶頸從來不是案源而是人力：洛杉磯一家律所用AI把人均客戶量從100做到500，這才是法律AI真正的市場。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法律科技</span><span class=\"tag\">AI應用層</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Vol.289｜四奪荊州，三分天下｜嘉賓：譚木聲\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-30-cn27f438-赤壁之战的真相-曹操目的不是灭吴-而是追杀刘备/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"東\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">東腔西調</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>赤壁之戰的真相：曹操目的不是滅吳，而是追殺劉備</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">曹操寫給孫權的那封信是恐嚇信而非勸降信——他南下真實目標是追殺逃亡的劉備，撞上主動迎戰的孫權，才被意外拖進赤壁之戰，火也燒在烏林而非赤壁。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">荊州</span><span class=\"tag\">三國</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Anthropic Opens the Kimono, Bubble Questions and Frontier Costs, Q&amp;A on Meta, Starlink, Brewers S1 neoclouds Starshield benefit corporation aggregator of aggregators circular financing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-30-sharptech-anthropic的800亿美元-亏损-只是一场会计幻觉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a309a358a363994-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Sharp Tech</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic的800億美元「虧損」只是一場會計幻覺</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這筆錢是亞馬遜可轉換貸款隨估值重新計價產生的賬面差額，沒有現金流出；真正該擔心的是訓練成本的增速已經超過服務成本，且完全不受自己控制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span><span class=\"tag\">IPO</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"“Everyone Else Has One”: What Your Kid’s Envy Is Really Telling You SIREN benign envy / malicious envy 시기 (Shigi) 부러워 (Puro) 장손 (Jangson)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-30-raisinggh-孩子吵着要iphone-其实要的是不被排除在外/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/071e8b2d9bfabca5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">29:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>孩子吵著要iPhone,其實要的是不被排除在外</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">社會學家 Stacy Kim 說嫉妒本身是中性信號：你只會嫉妒離你夠近、你也真正在意的人，學會不盯著對方而是追問感受本身，才能把嫉妒變成行動。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">嫉妒心理</span><span class=\"tag\">親子溝通</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"PHP2Shell Won&#x27;t Be the Last Big AI Cybersecurity Risk minus one-day vulnerability centaur hacker formal verification Pass the Planet\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-30-oddlots-已知两年没人能利用的php漏洞-ai一天写出了攻击代码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">49:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>已知兩年沒人能利用的PHP漏洞，AI一天寫出了攻擊代碼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">PHP基金會兩年前就知道這個漏洞，卻因為沒人能證明能利用它而擱置未修；AI一天內就寫出了遠程攻陷網站的完整攻擊代碼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WHOOP CEO, Will Ahmed: 50B Hours of Health Data, a 4 Million Member Data Moat, &amp; the FDA Fight HRV GLP-1 AFib 510(k) ICP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-allin-血压监测算健康产品不算医疗器械-whoop硬刚fda赢了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/157d273f0c076aa6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">55:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>血壓監測算健康產品不算醫療器械，Whoop硬剛FDA贏了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Whoop堅持把血壓監測算作健康功能而非醫療器械，頂住FDA一封警告信，最終促成FDA更新審批指南，血壓功能至今仍留在產品裡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可穿戴設備</span><span class=\"tag\">訂閱制轉型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What I learned about power from LBJ and Robert Moses public authority unanimous consent agreement YIMBY\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-dwarkesh-没人选他-他却靠法案里一句话把权力焊进了宪法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c00f9336512a8100-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">24:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>沒人選他，他卻靠法案裡一句話把權力焊進了憲法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">羅伯特·摩斯從未當選任何公職，卻把徵收通行費、留存盈餘的權力寫進了債券合同——美國憲法保護合同不可侵犯，這一招讓他的權力比任何市長、州長的任期都更難撼動。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">權力</span><span class=\"tag\">政治操作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Luke Muehlhauser on the most important AI safety work nobody is doing TEDAI neuralese reward hacking focused research organizations impact investing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-eightythousand-ai安全圈不缺钱-缺的是愿意辞职去当创始人的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c28893c5b3ed220c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">2:36:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>AI安全圈不缺錢，缺的是願意辭職去當創始人的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">資金不是AI安全的瓶頸——會審查申請、願意辭職創業去填補「AI的FDA」「AI的NTSB」這類機構空白的人，才是真正稀缺的東西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">慈善資助</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Preparing for a Career During in Age of Artificial Intelligence prestige trap case method experiential learning\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-mastersinbiz-哈佛商学院前院长-学生该做的不是用ai-是跟ai辩论/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ceeab3e81fd72a7b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">15:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>哈佛商學院前院長：學生該做的不是用AI，是跟AI辯論</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他要求學生在課堂上大聲讀出AI給的答案，再說清楚哪裡同意、哪裡反對——這種帶著審問的協作，才是AI時代真正能帶進職場的能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI與就業</span><span class=\"tag\">批判性思維</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Startups Rebuilding American Industry | The AD50 dual use valley of death co-engineering low mix high volume / high mix low volume AD50 manufacturing middle\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-a16z-国防订单替美国工厂买单-受益的将是机器人和医疗设备/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">50:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>國防訂單替美國工廠買單，受益的將是機器人和醫療設備</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">國防合同替美國工廠礦山買單最貴的開廠成本，這些產能和工藝最終流向機器人、能源電網和消費品，而不只是武器本身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">國防科技</span><span class=\"tag\">先進製造</span>\n</div></div></a>"]